# Never version half-written files. Each pipeline command stages its output under a hidden
# name and renames it into place when complete, so staging left by a running or killed command
# is excluded from DVC snapshots:
#   .building-*  dataset release being written (agentwatch_data.build)
#   .adding-*    evidence entry being copied (agentwatch_data.evidence)
#   .attempt-*   quality-gate attempt being committed (agentwatch_validation.gate)
#   .*.tmp       build report, split file, or schema being written
.building-*
.adding-*
.attempt-*
.*.tmp
